<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7720"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Amandab<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Amandab<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 10:37 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Quote from Pax56: <BR> <BR>Q I AM CLD DL  <BR> <BR>My guess would be that CLD is either &#34;called&#34; or &#34;cold&#34; with vowels and duplicates removed. BTK is possibly multilingual, so he may well be familiar with languages that omit vowels and/or duplicates in writing, plus it&#39;s a standard word puzzle trick. I was leaning toward &#34;called&#34; earlier, but &#34;cold&#34; takes on new meaning with Tom&#39;s cryptic reference to ice trays, and all the running faucet stuff. But what&#39;s DL? Maybe it&#39;s like PJ - first/last or first/middle initials. But it could also be a first name, like Dale, with the vowels removed. Unfortunately, that&#39;s a lot of names, if you care to dig through them all. I did. Consider &#42;D&#42;L&#42; where &#42; = any combination of vowels or duplicated consonants D or L. Ouch. But it might be worth bumping those names up the suspect list - again, assuming it&#39;s not random junk and I&#39;m not reading too much into it.  <BR>-------------------------------------------------- <BR> <BR>Pax56- <BR> <BR>It is probably nothing, but here&#39;s my take on this particular line. Given the ice cube clues we have, perhaps someone told BTK &#34;I am cold.&#34; while he was killing them? <BR> <BR>Someone, perhaps, like Deanna Law? <BR> <BR>Maybe BTK is trying to take credit for her killing?  <BR> <BR>I dunno....just guessing now.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7720-->
