</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 20, 2005 - 3:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->look what i found <BR><a href="http://www.sabine.k12.la.us/class/Templates/Code%20Cracker.XLT" target=_top>http://www.sabine.k12.la.us/class/Templates/Code%2 0Cracker.XLT</a> <BR>look familiar?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
