</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 6:22 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Bmodule-I have two good words for your &#34;gutteral sounding insult&#34; <BR> <BR>1. <b>Reprobate</b> : to condemn strongly as unworthy, unacceptable, or evil <BR> <BR>And my favorite <BR> <BR>2. <b>Degenerate</b>:1 a : having declined &#40;as in nature, character, structure, or function&#41; from an ancestral or former state b : having sunk to a condition below that which is normal to a type; especially : having sunk to a lower and usually corrupt and vicious state<!--/Text--></td></tr>
